37
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:29,230
你一个人来了
You're alone.

38
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,410
要告诉我为什么吗
Wanna tell me why?

39
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:34,590
他还没准备好
He's not ready.

40
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,800
真纯会需要马特·默多克
The Chaste needs Matt Murdock.

41
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:41,650
我试过了  可我说服不了他
I've tried... but I couldn't convince him.

42
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,490
胡扯  你是故意让他脱身的
Bullshit. You let him off the hook.

43
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,750
我派你做过比这难得多的事  艾丽卡
I've sent you to do things a lot harder than this, Elektra.

44
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,350
你说的一切我都照办了
I did everything you said.

45
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:56,320
我让他对自己最阴暗的冲动屈服了  可他很顽强
I made him give in to his darkest impulses, but he's stubborn.

46
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:58,790
我无法改变他的心意或秉性
I can't change his mind or who he is.

47
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,370
相反  你让他改变了你
Instead, you let him change who you are.

48
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:05,330
-并不是这样  -当然是这样
- That's not what happened. - 'Course it is.

49
00:01:06,710 --> 00:01:08,180
你来见我的时候
When have you ever come to me

50
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:11,650
什么时候夹过尾巴  还给自己找借口
with your tail between your legs, making excuses?

51
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,970
我还以为你不至如此  然而
Thought you were stronger than that, but...

52
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:18,060
看看你现在这样
here you are,

53
00:01:18,410 --> 00:01:21,940
因为你爱上了他
'cause... you fell in love.

54
00:01:23,930 --> 00:01:27,230
我们就要开战了  没时间想那些
We're going to war. We don't have time for that.

55
00:01:27,450 --> 00:01:29,860
不管你觉得你有什么感觉
For whatever it is you think you're feeling.

56
00:01:31,370 --> 00:01:33,180
他做不到你我做的事
He can't do what you and I do.

57
00:01:33,910 --> 00:01:36,470
暴力是他的本性  但必须达到一个点才会爆发
The violence is part of him, but only to a point.

58
00:01:36,950 --> 00:01:38,900
他永远不会听人命令去杀人
He'll never be able to kill on command.

59
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:41,130
这可说明他是好人  艾丽  
That doesn't make him good, Ellie.

60
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:42,530
只说明他是弱者
It makes him weak.

61
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:46,150
不说默多克了
Forget Murdock.

62
00:01:46,950 --> 00:01:50,550
手和会动作很快  有事要发生了  我们得更快
The Hand's moving fast. Something's coming. We gotta move faster.

63
00:01:54,010 --> 00:01:56,980
也许有别的方法打赢你说的这场战争
Maybe there's another way to win this war you talk about...

64
00:01:58,230 --> 00:01:59,630
而不用牺牲这么多人
without so much death?

65
00:02:01,070 --> 00:02:04,630
不管你愿不愿意  艾丽  还会有更多人死
Like it or not, Ellie, more death is coming.

66
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:09,490
而你我得躲开点
And you and me gotta get out of its way.

67
00:04:21,420 --> 00:04:23,360
我们不能再像这样见面了
We gotta stop meeting like this.

68
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:31,020
-我什么都不记得了  -我帮你唤醒一下记忆
- I don't remember anything. - Well, let me refresh your memory.

69
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:34,640
两具尸体  身份未知
Two bodies, unidentified.

70
00:04:34,780 --> 00:04:37,940
一具没了头  一具被刺穿了
One headless, the other impaled.

71
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:39,490
你要告诉我昨晚发生了什么吗
You wanna tell me what happened last night?

72
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:42,360
-其他人呢  -那用不着你操心
- Where are the others? - That's none of your business.

73
00:04:42,460 --> 00:04:45,730
但你要是不愿配合  要找你的律师
But if you wanna play it coy and ask to speak to your lawyer,

74
00:04:45,730 --> 00:04:47,590
你该知道他们也收拾了他
you should know that they knocked his ass out, too.

75
00:04:47,590 --> 00:04:50,320
-丹尼·兰德呢  -丹尼·兰德也在场
- Where's Danny Rand? - Danny Rand was there?

76
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:54,350
-我得走了  -而我得知道答案
- I need to go. - And I need some answers.

77
00:04:54,850 --> 00:04:58,380
我们从简单的开始  那两具尸体是谁
Look, we'll start out easy. Who are the bodies?

78
00:04:59,770 --> 00:05:00,790
谁杀了他们
Who killed them?

79
00:05:01,850 --> 00:05:02,930
是你吗
Was it you?

80
00:05:04,490 --> 00:05:05,350
不是
No.

81
00:05:05,610 --> 00:05:07,910
又不是完全没可能
Well, it's not like it's completely out of the question.

82
00:05:07,910 --> 00:05:09,190
你以前就干过
You've done it before.

83
00:05:11,210 --> 00:05:13,420
我知道你想干什么  没用的
I know what you're trying to do and it's not gonna work.

84
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:15,390
如果不是你杀的  那是谁
If you didn't kill them, then who did?

85
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:18,470
你在浪费时间  好吗
You are wasting time, okay?

86
00:05:18,470 --> 00:05:21,790
-会有人受伤的  -已经有人受伤了
- People are going to get hurt. - People are already hurt.

87
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,540
其他人怎么样了
What happened to the others?

88
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:27,340
他们在走廊那头
They're down the hall.

89
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:29,620
-他们还好吗  -看起来是的
- Are they okay? - Looks like it.

90
00:05:30,150 --> 00:05:33,270
听着  你得知道我们是一边的
Listen, I need you to realize we are on the same side.

91
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:36,830
我兑现了我的谈判条件  我保护了你的朋友
Now, I held up my end of the bargain. I protected your friends.

92
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:38,910
你是时候让我加入了
It's about damn time you dealt me in.

93
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:42,840
有一个很奇怪的影子组织
There's a weird shadow organization.

94
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:45,720
我一直在追踪他们
I've been tracking them.

95
00:05:46,230 --> 00:05:47,590
你做得可不怎么样
Not very well.

96
00:05:49,150 --> 00:05:50,450
有多少人
How many were there?

97
00:05:51,850 --> 00:05:55,590
就一个  追杀约翰·雷蒙德的那个
Just one. The same one that came after John Raymond.

98
00:05:56,190 --> 00:06:00,060
什么人能打晕你和卢克·凯奇
What kind of person knocks out you and Luke Cage?

99
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,900
就算我说了  你可能也不会信
I'm not sure you'd believe me even if I told you.

100
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:07,830
试试看
Try me.

101
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,410
-马特  冷静  -福吉  我们在哪
- Matt. Hold on. - Foggy? Where are we?

102
00:06:23,410 --> 00:06:25,420
哈莱姆分局  私人办公室
Harlem precinct. Private office.

103
00:06:26,250 --> 00:06:29,520
要是描述一下完整画面  你看起来很糟
And if we're painting the whole picture, you look like shit.

104
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:33,040
-他们拿了你的衣服去采集血样了  -好
- They took your shirt for blood samples. - Right.

105
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:35,370
克莱尔简单查看了你的伤  骨头没断
Claire gave you a quick look. Nothing's broken.

106
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:37,780
但警察有很多疑问
But the cops have a lot of questions.

107
00:06:38,590 --> 00:06:42,700
-我当时没穿制服  -我知道  老天开眼
- I wasn't wearing the suit. - I know. There is a God after all.

108
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:46,300
天  我得走了  他有危险
Oh, God, I need to go. He's in danger.

109
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:49,310
-谁  -丹尼·兰德  他们抓了他
- Who? - Danny Rand. Uh, they took him.

110
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:52,320
-那个亿万富翁  -棍叟
- The billionaire? - Stick.

111
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,060
她杀了棍叟
She killed Stick.

112
00:07:07,210 --> 00:07:08,700
对  丹尼  他们抓了丹尼
Yeah, Danny. They took Danny.

113
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:12,300
现在我得把他从手和会手里救出来
And then now, I have to save him from the Hand.

114
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:14,860
你现在这状态可救不了任何人
You are in no position to save anybody.

115
00:07:14,860 --> 00:07:15,740
他们还没提起诉讼
They haven't pressed charges,

116
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:17,160
但他们发现你身边有两具死尸
but they found you with two dead bodies.

117
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,310
我别无选择  他是铁拳
I don't have a choice. He's the Iron Fist.

118
00:07:19,310 --> 00:07:20,830
我可不打算假装我听懂了
I'm not gonna pretend to know what that means.

119
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:25,560
福吉  干这事的人  抓了兰德的人
Foggy, the person who did this, who, uh, who took Danny...

120
00:07:26,730 --> 00:07:27,690
是艾丽卡
It's Elektra.

121
00:07:29,310 --> 00:07:31,900
-你前女友  -我知道这听起来多荒唐
- Your ex-girlfriend? - I understand how it sounds.

122
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:34,000
-她死了  -并没有  至少又活了
- She's dead. - She's not. Not anymore.

123
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,600
手和会抓了她  他们对她做了什么
The Hand took her. They did something to her.

124
00:07:35,610 --> 00:07:37,110
不管她是什么  都不是她自己了
Whatever she is, she's not herself.

125
00:07:37,110 --> 00:07:39,080
马特  你得喘口气
Matt, you need to take a breath.

126
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,680
-你这话像疯了  -我不管你信不信
- You sound insane. - I don't care if you believe me.

127
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:42,320
不管他们要对丹尼·兰德做什么
Whatever they're gonna do with Danny Rand,

128
00:07:42,330 --> 00:07:44,510
对任何人都不会有好处
it is not good for anyone.

129
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:50,590
-默多克先生  -你是吗  警探
- Mr. Murdock. - Yes. Is that you, Detective?

130
00:07:50,610 --> 00:07:51,570
你醒了
You're up.

131
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,920
你有一个客户在走廊那头吓得快尿裤子了
I've got one of your clients scared shitless across the hallway,

132
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,330
还有一个直接晕了
and the other one passed out,

133
00:07:56,340 --> 00:07:59,120
所以我需要你回答几个问题
so I'm gonna need for you to answer a few questions.

134
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,990
很遗憾
well, unfortunately,

135
00:08:01,230 --> 00:08:03,950
刚才发生的事都受保密协议的保护
whatever happened is protected by attorney-client privilege.

136
00:08:04,470 --> 00:08:07,080
真有趣  不过废话少说
That's cute, but cut the shit.

137
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:10,200
因为我们都清楚你不仅是个律师
'Cause we both know you're not just a lawyer in all this.

138
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,580
你还有别的身份
You're something more.

139
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:13,810
目前来说  你是嫌疑人
As of right now, you're a person of interest.

140
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:15,520
罪行的目击证人
A witness to a crime.

141
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:16,820
证人
A witness?

142
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:20,620
你想让我描述下我都听到了什么吗  警探
What, do you want me to describe how it sounded, Detective?

143
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:23,860
也许你没听到我刚才说"废话少说"
Perhaps you didn't hear me when I said, "Cut the shit."

144
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,980
我听说他们抓走了丹尼·兰德
Now I hear they took Danny Rand.

145
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:27,770
这种备受关注的人物
A person with that high of a profile?

146
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:31,840
如果这事怪在你头上  你的生活将步履维艰
If this falls back on you... it's gonna make your life miserable.

147
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:35,250
听着  我想帮忙
Look, uh... I wanna help.

148
00:08:35,550 --> 00:08:36,610
我不能多说
I can't say much,

149
00:08:36,610 --> 00:08:39,350
不过他现在确实处境不妙
apart from the fact that he is in way over his head.

150
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:41,090
我们得帮他
And we need to help him.

151
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:44,300
默多克先生  恕我直言
Mr. Murdock, all due respect,

152
00:08:44,650 --> 00:08:46,710
你得开始考虑怎么拯救自己了
you need to start worrying about helping yourself.

153
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:55,350
他的脉搏升高了一些
His pulse is up a little.

154
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,500
是好事吗
Is that good?

155
00:08:58,610 --> 00:09:01,990
只要不突然激增  当然是好事
Long as it doesn't spike irregularly, sure.

156
00:09:06,100 --> 00:09:07,240
你觉得那是什么东西
What do you think it was?

157
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,650
某种药物
Some kinda drug.

158
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:13,260
他们在犯罪现场找到了某种焚香
They found a weird incense at the crime scene.

159
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:20,300
他的皮肤刀枪不入  其余部分就不是了
His skin's what's bulletproof. The rest of him is not.

160
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:24,290
你觉得丹尼会活下来吗
You think Danny would have survived it?

161
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:28,450
我不知道  科琳
I don't know, Colleen.

162
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:34,810
好吧  我们得弄清发生了什么
Okay, we need to find out what happened.

163
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,000
他还要昏迷多久
How long until he wakes up?

164
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:41,460
可能一个小时  也可能一周
Could be an hour. Could be a week.

165
00:09:46,410 --> 00:09:47,180
我知道
I know.

166
00:09:53,310 --> 00:09:55,600
天啊  我们怎么会沦落到这
God, how the hell did we get here?

167
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,240
和他们一起
With them?

168
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:04,460
我竭尽所能避开有超能力的人
I did everything I could to avoid people with abilities.

169
00:10:05,710 --> 00:10:06,720
辞了工作
Quit my job.

170
00:10:08,140 --> 00:10:09,570
搬到了上城区
Moved my ass uptown.

171
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:13,410
-结果怎么样  -你说呢
- And how'd that work out? - You tell me.

172
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,720
我这跟班当得还行吧
Is sidekick a good look on me?

173
00:10:17,100 --> 00:10:20,100
他们在进行一场正义的战斗  你也是
They are fighting a good fight. You're doing it, too.

174
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,150
和他们不同
Not like them.

175
00:10:23,450 --> 00:10:24,690
甚至和杰西卡不同
And even Jessica.

176
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:27,150
注定要有逃离火场的人
There are people who run from the fire,

177
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:30,360
也有义无反顾冲进去的人
and there are people who run into it.

178
00:10:30,850 --> 00:10:31,740
这些傻子
Dumb people.

179
00:10:33,350 --> 00:10:37,100
你说过我是团队的基础  对吗
Okay, you said I was the foundation, right?

180
00:10:39,450 --> 00:10:40,470
看看镜中的自己
Look in the mirror.

181
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:42,810
即便在遇到卢克之前
Even before you met Luke,

182
00:10:42,810 --> 00:10:47,510
你也不是那种会袖手旁观的人
you weren't the type who could just... stand by and watch.

183
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:49,910
对吗
Were you?

184
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:56,830
克莱尔
Claire?

185
00:11:01,370 --> 00:11:04,590
-我在哪  -你在警局  感觉怎么样
- Where am I? - You're in the precinct. How do you feel?

186
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,790
丹尼怎么了
What happened to Danny?

187
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:10,230
他还活着吗
Is he alive?

188
00:11:31,010 --> 00:11:33,530
这不是我们的行事方式
This is not how we do business.

189
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,480
现在是了
It is now.

190
00:11:35,690 --> 00:11:40,530
不管你是不是黑空  我们现在是三对一
Black Sky or not, there are three of us and one of you.

191
00:11:40,540 --> 00:11:41,970
这是在挑衅吗
Is that a challenge?

192
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:45,100
我们会竭尽所能维护我们的组织
We will do what is needed to preserve our organization.

193
