195
00:11:52,270 --> 00:11:54,490
你愿意以此冒险吗
Is that a gamble you're willing to take?

196
00:11:58,460 --> 00:12:01,040
手和会是个全球性组织
The Hand is a global organization.

197
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:04,710
这些年来  亚历山德拉一直致力于
For years, Alexandra fostered relationships

198
00:12:04,710 --> 00:12:08,740
发展与犯罪头目乃至企业合伙人的联系
with everything from crime lords to corporate partners.

199
