Suit yourself.

225
00:13:37,310 --> 00:13:38,910
我们没能确定
We've had no luck identifying

226
00:13:38,910 --> 00:13:40,630
在仓库一并发现的那些尸体的身份
the bodies we found in the warehouse with you.

227
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:43,210
今天你们两个有不少犯罪记录
And though you two have colorful histories,

228
00:13:43,210 --> 00:13:45,090
我已经提醒纽约警方
