Now, I trust Detective Knight,

232
00:13:50,430 --> 00:13:53,360
她说  虽然你们都严守口风
and she says that, although you're being tight-lipped,

233
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,200
最佳策略
the best way to proceed

234
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,950
是把你们当做证人  而不是嫌犯
is to treat you as witnesses and not suspects.

235
00:13:56,960 --> 00:14:00,020
你们掌握了能填补空白的信息  我们需要它
You have information that can fill in the gaps. We need it.

236
00:14:00,390 --> 00:14:01,130
我们的特遣队
Our task force

237
00:14:01,130 --> 00:14:04,030
追踪一个神秘犯罪组织数月了
has been tracking a mysterious crime syndicate for months.

238
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:06,310
他们行动快  会掩盖行踪
