358
00:21:50,970 --> 00:21:52,360
如果他们认为丹尼是钥匙
If they think Danny's a key,

359
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:54,640
那么他能打开的东西  或许在那个建筑里
maybe whatever it is he unlocks is in that structure.

360
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:56,660
天呐  这真是最蠢...
Oh, my God, this is the dumbest...

361
00:21:56,660 --> 00:21:58,550
问题是  我们该怎么办
The question is, what are we gonna do about it?

362
